at selection is not needed.":["Az \u00fcgyfelek egy leg\u00f6rd\u00fcl\u0151 men\u00fct l\u00e1tnak az \u00fcl\u0151hely\u00fck kiv\u00e1laszt\u00e1s\u00e1hoz. Az el\u00e9rhet\u0151 \u00fcl\u0151helyek azonos\u00edt\u00f3 szerint rendezett list\u00e1ban jelennek meg. Ez kisebb helysz\u00ednekhez ide\u00e1lis, vagy ha nincs sz\u00fcks\u00e9g vizu\u00e1lis \u00fcl\u0151hely-kiv\u00e1laszt\u00e1sra."],"Visual Layout (Seat Map)":["Vizu\u00e1lis elrendez\u00e9s (\u00fcl\u00e9srend-t\u00e9rk\u00e9p)"],"Customers will see an interactive seat map where they can click on available seats. Occupied seats are shown in a different color. This provides a visual overview of the venue. (Premium feature)":["Az \u00fcgyfelek egy interakt\u00edv \u00fcl\u00e9srend-t\u00e9rk\u00e9pet l\u00e1tnak, ahol r\u00e1kattinthatnak az el\u00e9rhet\u0151 \u00fcl\u0151helyekre. A foglalt \u00fcl\u0151helyek m\u00e1s sz\u00ednben jelennek meg. Ez vizu\u00e1lis \u00e1ttekint\u00e9st ny\u00fajt a helysz\u00ednr\u0151l. (Pr\u00e9mium funkci\u00f3)"],"Seat":["\u00dcl\u0151hely"],"Seating Plan":["Ulesrend"],"Description":["Le\u00edr\u00e1s"],"Activate":["Aktivalas"],"Active":["Akt\u00edv"],"Inactive":["Inakt\u00edv"],"Status":["\u00c1llapot"],"Export CSV":["CSV export\u00e1l\u00e1s"],"Edit":["Szerkeszt\u00e9s"],"Delete":["T\u00f6rl\u00e9s"],"Cancel":["M\u00e9gse"],"Drag to reorder":["H\u00fazza az \u00e1trendez\u00e9shez"],"Remove":["Elt\u00e1vol\u00edt\u00e1s"],"Label":["Cimke"],"Name":["N\u00e9v"],"Show Layout":["Elrendezes megjelenitese"],"Hide Layout":["Elrendezes elrejtese"],"Delete %d seats?":["%d ulohely torlese?"],"%d seats updated":["%d ulohely frissitve"],"%d seats deleted":["%d ulohely torolve"],"%d seats processed, %d errors":["%d ulohely feldolgozva, %d hiba"],"selected":["kivalasztva"],"-- Action --":["-- Muvelet --"],"Deactivate":["Deaktivalas"],"Layout":["Elrendezes"],"Seats":["Ulohelyek"],"Actions":["M\u0171veletek"],"Visual (Seat Map)":["Vizualis (ulesterkep)"],"Simple (Dropdown)":["Eg